        "da_id": "ES2011c.A.dialog-act.dharshi.194",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011c",
        "text": "energy ?",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.A.dialog-act.dharshi.198",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011c",
        "text": "I mean we're gonna use batteries right ?",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.B.dialog-act.dharshi.133",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011c",
        "text": "Uh we actually had an option of batteries , solar power , and um a dynamo ,",
        "participant": "FEE042",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.A.dialog-act.dharshi.201",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011c",
        "text": "I think batteries sound good .",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.B.dialog-act.dharshi.123",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011c",
        "text": "I think the batteries would have to go right under the plastic case .",
        "participant": "FEE042",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.A.dialog-act.dharshi.184",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011c",
        "text": "Yeah ,",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.C.dialog-act.dharshi.240",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011c",
        "text": "Yeah .",
        "participant": "FEE043",
        "role": "UI"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.A.dialog-act.dharshi.193",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Um , so what d but what do we know about"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.A.dialog-act.dharshi.197",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "And <disfmarker>"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.B.dialog-act.dharshi.140",
        "participant": "FEE042",
        "role": "ID",
        "text": "Um but I think solar power's not available with the rubber case anyways ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.B.dialog-act.dharshi.141",
        "participant": "FEE042",
        "role": "ID",
        "text": "It <vocalsound> it seems a little weird for a living room anyways ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.A.dialog-act.dharshi.181",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Yeah ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011c.A.dialog-act.dharshi.185",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "th and that would <disfmarker> that <disfmarker>"
      }
    ],
    "peer_items": [
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011c#0",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "UI and ME will play with play-dough to prototype the look and feel of the design and the user interface."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011c#1",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "We will not include D_V_D_ (DVD) features in the remote design."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011c#2",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "There is uncertainty about whether to include a screen, given ambiguous use and the potential cost, with debate on its necessity versus a wheel-based control."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011c#3",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "We will pursue a fashion electronics approach with a fruit-and-vegetable motif, including the decision on whether the motif is printed or the remote resembles a fruit."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011c#4",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The menu system should reside inside the TV, not inside the remote."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011c#5",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "For now we will do two prototypes of the product."
      }
    ],
